{"root_text": {"uid": "ja500", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "සිරිමන්ද ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Golden Deer ", "uid": "ja501"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Prince Sivi ", "uid": "ja499"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja500' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>15. වීසති නිපාතය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>500. සිරිමන්ද ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv83' href='#msdiv83'>Msdiv 83</a>“ප්‍රඥාවෙන් යුක්තවූ ශ්‍රීයෙන් මනහරවු” යනාදී මේ සිරිමන්ද ප්‍රශ්නය මහා උම්මග්ග ජාතකයෙහි ප්‍රකාශ වන්නේය.</p>\n<a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv84' href='#msdiv84'>Msdiv 84</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv85' href='#msdiv85'>Msdiv 85</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv86' href='#msdiv86'>Msdiv 86</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv87' href='#msdiv87'>Msdiv 87</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv88' href='#msdiv88'>Msdiv 88</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv89' href='#msdiv89'>Msdiv 89</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv90' href='#msdiv90'>Msdiv 90</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv91' href='#msdiv91'>Msdiv 91</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv92' href='#msdiv92'>Msdiv 92</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv93' href='#msdiv93'>Msdiv 93</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv94' href='#msdiv94'>Msdiv 94</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv95' href='#msdiv95'>Msdiv 95</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv96' href='#msdiv96'>Msdiv 96</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv97' href='#msdiv97'>Msdiv 97</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv98' href='#msdiv98'>Msdiv 98</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv99' href='#msdiv99'>Msdiv 99</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv100' href='#msdiv100'>Msdiv 100</a> <a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv101' href='#